  "title": "Planet of the Vapes Glass Cooling Stem",
  "description": "Dimpled cooling\n\nThe Planet of the Vapes Glass Cooling Stem is an extended glass stem for a variety of popular vaporizers (see compatibility below). It features dimpled insertions that further purify and refine your vapor.\n\nDesign features\n\nThese stems are 2.5 inches long and come in seven different colors, so pick your style!\n\nCompatible with DynaVap tips and caps\n\nThat’s right, these stems serve a dual purpose. Attach a DynaVap tip and cap to the stem and now you have a butane powered vape!\n\nAlso compatible with the following Products\n\nThe Glass Cooling Stem is compatible with:\n\nPlanet of the Vapes Lobo\n\nPlanet of the Vapes ONE\n\nPOTV XMAX V3 Pro\n\nPOTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro\n\nPAX Glass Adapter\n\nMighty+ Glass Adapter\n\nCrafty+ Glass Adapter\n\nVolcano Glass Adapter\n\nReturn policy\n\nWe only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.",
  "description_html": "<h2>Dimpled cooling<br /> </h2>\n<p>The Planet of the Vapes Glass Cooling Stem is an extended glass stem for a variety of popular vaporizers (see compatibility below). It features dimpled insertions that further purify and refine your vapor.</p>\n<h2>Design features<br /> </h2>\n<p>These stems are 2.5 inches long and come in seven different colors, so pick your style!</p>\n<h2>Compatible with DynaVap tips and caps</h2>\n<p>That&#8217;s right, these stems serve a dual purpose. Attach a<span> </span><a href=\"https://hdt7rb1b5mmrm7qy-2099072.shopifypreview.com/collections/dynavap-parts-accessories\">DynaVap tip and cap</a> to the stem<span> </span>and now you have a butane powered vape!</p>\n<h2>Also compatible with the following Products</h2>\n<p><span>The Glass Cooling Stem is compatible with: </span></p>\n<p><a title=\"Planet of the Vapes Lobo Vaporizer\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/planet-of-the-vapes-lobo\">Planet of the Vapes Lobo</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-one-vaporizer\" title=\"One\">Planet of the Vapes ONE </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/xmax-v3-pro-vaporizer\" title=\"XMAX V3 Pro\">POTV XMAX V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"POTV Bubbler, Water Pipe &amp; Glass Accessory Adapter for V3 Pro\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-adapter-v3-pro\">POTV Glass Adapter for V3 Pro</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/potv-glass-accessory-adapter-for-pax\" title=\"PAX Glass Adapter Attachment\">PAX Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/mighty-mighty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Mighty+ glass adapter\">Mighty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/crafty-plus-glass-adapter\" title=\"Crafty+ Glass Adapter\">Crafty+ Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"Volno Glass Adapter\" href=\"https://ca.planetofthevapes.com/products/volcano-glass-adapter\">Volcano Glass Adapter</a></p>\n<h2>Return policy</h2>\n<p>We only accept returns for accessories if they are within 30 days, unused and unopened, or if they are being returned with a vaporizer under our 14-day satisfaction policy.</p>\n<ul></ul>",
